    "凭据只保存在系统 Keychain，不会写入日志、不会发送给大模型。移除服务器只清理本机数据，NAS 上的音乐不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Credentials are stored only in the system Keychain; never logged or sent to the model. Removing a server only clears local data; NAS music is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證僅儲存在系統鑰匙圈，不會寫入記錄檔、不會傳送給大模型。移除伺服器只清理本機資料，NAS 上的音樂不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
