    "目录保存在本机 SQLite（含全文检索索引），按服务器隔离。助手只查询你需要的结果，绝不会把整个曲库发给大模型。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Library is stored in local SQLite (with full-text index), isolated per server. The assistant only queries what you need and never sends the whole library to the model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "資料庫儲存在本機 SQLite（含全文檢索索引），以伺服器隔離。助理只查詢你需要的結果，絕不會將整個曲庫傳送給大模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
